# The Bare Bones (bastok 38): Degenhard and Biggorf in Bastok Markets. The offer, Biggorf's 257 while accepted, the bone
# chip trade, the key item and exp reward, no repeat. Degenhard's own script answers what the quest does not.
lists BastokMarkets/Degenhard/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Degenhard/onTrade BastokMarkets/Biggorf/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/256 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/258
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-173,2,-135
item BoneChip x3
item CopperIngot
login
trade Degenhard BoneChip x1     # available: no quest trade handler, his script's onTrade (false)
trigger Biggorf                 # available: his default 126
finish
trigger Degenhard               # the offer, 256
finish                          # accepted
trigger Biggorf                 # accepted: 257
finish
trigger Degenhard               # accepted: no quest action, his default 255
finish
trade Degenhard CopperIngot x1  # the wrong item: nothing
trade Degenhard BoneChip x1     # 258
finish                          # completed: the Map of the Dangruf Wadi, 2000 exp, fame 20, a chip gone
trigger Biggorf                 # completed: 126
finish
walk -173,2,-135                # back to Degenhard (a trade does not walk to the NPC)
trade Degenhard BoneChip x1     # completed: nothing
